WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.502
-Jennifer, you were telling me

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.602
how recently you tried
ax throwing for the first time.

00:00:03.602 --> 00:00:04.871
You challenged me
to a little competition.

00:00:04.871 --> 00:00:06.405
And I don't know why,
but I said yes.

00:00:06.405 --> 00:00:09.208
So we're going to take turns
throwing axes at that target

00:00:09.208 --> 00:00:11.444
which we found in the old
"Tonight Show" prop room.

00:00:11.444 --> 00:00:12.812
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:17.050
10 points for the hat,
5 for the body, 2 for the legs,

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:20.486
and uno, as the French say,
for the hands.

00:00:20.486 --> 00:00:21.454
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:22.989
We'll throw three axes each.

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:25.124
Most points at the end
is the winner.

00:00:25.124 --> 00:00:27.460
I will take the first throw.
Stand back.

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:28.695
-Okay.

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:32.432
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.070
[ Drumroll ]

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:39.706
-Here comes daddy!

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:41.975
Hu-oh!

00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:44.044
[ Audience groans ]
[ Cowbell ]

00:00:48.881 --> 00:00:50.149
No, stop, hey!

00:00:50.149 --> 00:00:51.785
Put that thing down.

00:00:51.785 --> 00:00:53.085
Oh, my --

00:00:53.085 --> 00:00:54.120
-Do I go now?

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:55.288
-We just killed
the stage manager.

00:00:55.288 --> 00:00:56.956
Okay, don't worry about it.
It's fine.

00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:58.424
It's totally fine.
Jennifer, you go.

00:00:58.424 --> 00:00:59.726
[ Drumroll ]

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:01.828
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:01.828 --> 00:01:03.163
[ Cowbell ]

00:01:05.198 --> 00:01:06.799
Gosh.

00:01:06.799 --> 00:01:08.033
[ Drumroll ]

00:01:08.033 --> 00:01:10.836
-Hey, Jimmy,
I just remembered something.

00:01:10.836 --> 00:01:12.071
No!

00:01:12.071 --> 00:01:15.041
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:18.144
-Wait a minute.
Stop, stop, stop, stop.

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:20.546
-What?
-Stop, stop.

00:01:20.546 --> 00:01:23.182
Can we take that off?
-What?

00:01:23.182 --> 00:01:25.952
-What?
We have to take it off?

00:01:25.952 --> 00:01:29.722
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.722 --> 00:01:32.158
-Just make sure --

00:01:32.158 --> 00:01:33.326
-What?

00:01:33.326 --> 00:01:35.361
-Make sure --

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:36.729
-What?

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:38.731
-Got a lot of wood there.

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:40.066
[ Laughter ]
[ Cowbell ]

00:01:40.066 --> 00:01:42.902 line:0%
Make sure you go for the --
the hat.

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:44.270 line:0%
[ Drumroll ]

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:46.439 line:0%
[ Cheers ]

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:47.941 line:0%
[ Audience groans ]
[ Cowbell ]

00:01:47.941 --> 00:01:49.375 line:0%
-Ugh.

00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:52.378 line:0%
I feel like maybe I should just
keep throwing until I win.

00:01:52.378 --> 00:01:53.612 line:0%
I don't know.

00:01:53.612 --> 00:01:55.481 line:0%
-I split it right down
the middle right there.

00:01:55.481 --> 00:01:56.649 line:0%
That is --

00:01:56.649 --> 00:01:58.284 line:0%
[ Drumroll ]

00:01:58.284 --> 00:02:01.321 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:04.057 --> 00:02:07.260 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Oh, my God!

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:10.363 line:0%
Oh, my God!

00:02:10.363 --> 00:02:12.231 line:0%
-Come on.

00:02:12.231 --> 00:02:14.900 line:0%
-Get away.

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:16.869 line:0%
Oh!
-Oh, my goodness.

00:02:16.869 --> 00:02:19.372 line:0%
-Oh, my God!
-Oh, my goodness.

00:02:19.372 --> 00:02:20.540 line:0%
[ Drumroll ]

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:22.641 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:22.641 --> 00:02:25.778 line:0%
-There we go.
I win, the champion!

00:02:25.778 --> 00:02:27.880 line:0%
-Oh!

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:29.715 line:0%
Oh!

00:02:29.715 --> 00:02:31.650
God!

00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:33.986
-No! Stop, stop, stop.

00:02:33.986 --> 00:02:35.888
Jennifer Lawrence, everybody.

00:02:35.888 --> 00:02:39.058
"Mother" is in theaters --
Jennifer, stop -- on Friday.

00:02:39.058 --> 00:02:41.026
Pedro Pascal joins us
after the break.

00:02:41.026 --> 00:02:42.228
Come on back, everybody.

00:02:42.228 --> 00:02:43.496
Jennifer!

00:02:43.496 --> 00:02:45.331
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:45.331 --> 00:02:47.833
-♪ How do I feel,
kinda how the sky feels ♪

00:02:47.833 --> 00:02:51.271 line:0%
♪ Becoming sideways
like a side fill ♪

